(6367596, 942729, 38725, '<td valign="top">A very clever idea, I''m left trying to work out where the shell chips came from though as it looks like a clean cut.</td>', 'A very clever idea, I''m left trying to work out where the shell chips came from though as it looks like a clean cut.', '2011-03-30 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
