(6371151, 942836, 60173, '<td valign="top">The left side is a little tight and I can see the supporting lines, but thank you for not just setting the objects on a white background. That extra thought alone is going to get a higher score from me.</td>', 'The left side is a little tight and I can see the supporting lines, but thank you for not just setting the objects on a white background. That extra thought alone is going to get a higher score from me.', '2011-04-02 23:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
