(6376197, 942918, 105601, '<td valign="top">I''m really pleased at what a good reception this photo got.<br/>The sharpness of pictures is something I should be able to address with some more experience of my photo editing program (The GIMP). <br/> <br/>I''m just blown away by the 7 10/10 ratings!<br/>This will need to be my benchmark.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all votes and comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-06 06:39:58.</i></td>', 'I''m really pleased at what a good reception this photo got.The sharpness of pictures is something I should be able to address with some more experience of my photo editing program (The GIMP).  I''m just blown away by the 7 10/10 ratings!This will need to be my benchmark. Thanks for all votes and comments.', '2011-04-06 07:36:34.000000', '2011-04-06 07:39:58.000000', 0),
(6376206, 942576, 102278, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the red, black and white. That seemed to be everywhere in the 80s!</td>', 'I think it''s the red, black and white. That seemed to be everywhere in the 80s!', '2011-04-06 08:15:41.000000', NULL, 0),
