(6379437, 942516, 28359, '<td valign="top">Critique Club:<br/> <br/>Very interesting image. You nailed the composition. Great use of DOF. Looks like this board has been used and would hold some great memories. Your processing choice was a good one. If there was anything I think might improve the image would be to add a little noise to it, not a ton just a little. You have a Great eye for photography. Looking forward seeing  more of your work. I think it should had finished in the top ten for sure......ace</td>', 'Critique Club: Very interesting image. You nailed the composition. Great use of DOF. Looks like this board has been used and would hold some great memories. Your processing choice was a good one. If there was anything I think might improve the image would be to add a little noise to it, not a ton just a little. You have a Great eye for photography. Looking forward seeing  more of your work. I think it should had finished in the top ten for sure......ace', '2011-04-08 15:32:58.000000', NULL, 0),
